<title>UK: Aluminium loses more ground in LME inter-office.</title>
<headline>Aluminium loses more ground in LME inter-office.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Succumbs to copper's sharp late morning loss and sold down toward 1,540 support in lunchtime inter-office trade. Low of $1,545 so far.</p>
<p>COPPER - Fluctuates just above a seven-week low of $2,555 set late morning. Support $2,550.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Continues to ease ahead of Inco talks.</p>
<p>ZINC - Down with copper.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Slow.</p>
</text>
